            <profile id="ec3c-3069-73f3-eb1c" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="af20-e256-4a51-93aa" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapons, javelins and buckler. Skirmishers. Warband. Every other unit of Doer-chele may have bows (+1 pt) (Alba, Scotland, Picts); Picts may alternatively have hunting crossbows (free): these count as crossbows for all purposes except they have a range of 24" and are Strength 3. Not enforced: which units are bow-armed. (Shieldwall p.30)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
