              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapons, javelins and buckler. May exchange javelins for double-handed axes (+2 pts). Light Infantry. Warband. Different Weapons. Dogs of War cannot be accompanied by characters and cannot benefit from the Army General and Standard Bearer rules. (Shieldwall p.77)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="0f5a-0166-90ab-96e1" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
